# Code owners (T57 of docs/SALES-READINESS.md; docs/BUILD.md "Code
# owners"). With branch protection's "Require review from Code Owners", a
# change below needs an approval from the listed owner.
#
# The sections are by risk area, not by person: crypto and key handling,
# parsers of attacker-controlled bytes, the response path that touches the
# robot's network, packaging and release, CI. Today one maintainer owns
# them all; when area teams exist, replace the owner of a section with its
# team (e.g. @SingularityRD/robodr-crypto). Later lines win.

